<section id="Start">
    <h2>Start of the Convergence</h2>
    <p>
        Upon entering, Vloxx's Visage will be staring at you from the center of the stage.
        Run up and interact with his visage to start the convergence.
    </p>
    <img src=@Assets["/images/VoE/Convergence/Vloxx-Visage.png"] alt="Vloxx's Visage" style="max-width: 100%;" />
    <p>
        It's recommended that you have your subgroups setup <span style="text-decoration:underline">before</span> you start the convergence.
    </p>

    <h2>Pre phase</h2>
    <p>
        Immediately after starting the convergence, Vloxx will summon manifestations to attack you.
        Destroy them until the 'Manifestations Destroyed' bar is filled.
    </p>
    <p>
        After filling the bar, 3 champion cosmic manifestations will spawn. Kill all 3 to get to the next phase.
    </p>
</section>